{"id":"ff44b06d2b8cc1c120fdcc1bede39254ec5a2feb","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"ff44b06d2b8cc1c120fdcc1bede39254ec5a2feb","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/pnpr-retain-ecosystem-upstream-caches.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/pnpr\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpr cache-gc`, server startup, and background cache eviction now retain cached Cargo, Python, and OCI upstream files while their upstream registries remain configured. Before, orphan pruning deleted cached crate archives, Python wheels, source distributions, PEP 658 metadata, and OCI manifests and blobs even when their upstream registry was active."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/cache_maintenance/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -1,10 +1,13 @@"," use super::{","+    CacheGcEffect,","     inventory::{cas_digest_of_store_file, is_cache_tmp_file, is_managed_sqlite_file},","     is_abandoned_tmp_age,","-    orphans::count_dir_contents,","+    orphans::{PrivateScopePolicy, count_dir_contents, prune_orphaned_namespaces},"," };","+use crate::server::ecosystem::UpstreamCacheSubtree;"," use pnpm_fs::OpenDir;"," use std::{","+    collections::HashSet,","     path::{Path, PathBuf},","     time::Duration,"," };","@@ -190,3 +193,124 @@ fn windows_backslash_paths_classify_temps_sqlite_and_cas_digests() {","     let cas = Path::new(r\"C:\\pnpr\\cache\\resolver-store\\v11\\files\\0a\\bcdef01234-exec\");","     assert_eq!(cas_digest_of_store_file(cache, cas), Some(\"0abcdef01234\".to_string()));"," }","+","+fn write_cached_file(cache_dir: &Path, namespace: &str, rel: &str, bytes: &[u8]) -> PathBuf {","+    let mut path = cache_dir.to_path_buf();","+    path.extend(","+        namespace","+            .split('/')","+            .filter(|segment| !segment.is_empty()),","+    );","+    path.extend(rel.split('/'));","+    std::fs::create_dir_all(path.parent().unwrap()).unwrap();","+    std::fs::write(&path, bytes).unwrap();","+    path","+}","+","+fn populate_upstream_ecosystem_subtrees(cache_dir: &Path, namespace: &str) -> Vec<PathBuf> {","+    let cargo_artifact = UpstreamCacheSubtree::Artifact(b\"sha256-cargo\").within(namespace);","+    let pypi_artifact = UpstreamCacheSubtree::Artifact(b\"sha256-pypi\").within(namespace);","+    let pypi_metadata =","+        UpstreamCacheSubtree::Metadata(b\"https://pypi.org/whl\\ntrue\").within(namespace);","+    let oci_manifest = UpstreamCacheSubtree::OciManifest(b\"latest\").within(namespace);","+    let oci_blobs = UpstreamCacheSubtree::OciBlobs.within(namespace);","+    vec![","+        write_cached_file(cache_dir, namespace, \"packages/@/mycrate/document.json\", b\"{}\"),","+        write_cached_file(","+            cache_dir,","+            &cargo_artifact,","+            \"packages/@/mycrate/blobs/1.0.0.crate\",","+            b\"crate-bytes\",","+        ),","+        write_cached_file(","+            cache_dir,","+            &pypi_artifact,","+            \"packages/@/requests/blobs/requests-1.0.0-py3-none-any.whl\",","+            b\"wheel-bytes\",","+        ),","+        write_cached_file(","+            cache_dir,","+            &pypi_metadata,","+            \"packages/@/requests/document.json\",","+            b\"Metadata-Version: 2.1\\n\",","+        ),","+        write_cached_file(","+            cache_dir,","+            &oci_manifest,","+            \"packages/@library/alpine/document.json\",","+            b\"{\\\"schemaVersion\\\":2}\",","+        ),","+        write_cached_file(","+            cache_dir,","+            &oci_blobs,","+            \"packages/@library/alpine/blobs/sha256-deadbeef\",","+            b\"layer-bytes\",","+        ),","+    ]","+}","+","+#[tokio::test]","+async fn prune_orphaned_namespaces_keeps_active_ecosystem_subtrees_and_prunes_prefixed_siblings() {","+    let tmp = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+    let cache_dir = tmp.path();","+    let active = HashSet::from([\"~public/abc\".to_string(), \"~upstreams/priv\".to_string()]);","+","+    let active_public = populate_upstream_ecosystem_subtrees(cache_dir, \"~public/abc\");","+    let active_private = populate_upstream_ecosystem_subtrees(cache_dir, \"~upstreams/priv\");","+    let removed_public = populate_upstream_ecosystem_subtrees(cache_dir, \"~public/zzz\");","+    let removed_private = populate_upstream_ecosystem_subtrees(cache_dir, \"~upstreams/old\");","+","+    let prefix_without_dash =","+        write_cached_file(cache_dir, \"~public/abcdef\", \"packages/@/pkg/document.json\", b\"123\");","+    let prefix_with_dash =","+        write_cached_file(cache_dir, \"~public/abc-stale\", \"packages/@/pkg/document.json\", b\"456\");","+    let private_prefix_without_dash =","+        write_cached_file(cache_dir, \"~upstreams/privdef\", \"packages/@/pkg/document.json\", b\"789\");","+","+    let dry = prune_orphaned_namespaces(","+        cache_dir,","+        &active,","+        PrivateScopePolicy::Keep,","+        CacheGcEffect::DryRun,","+    )","+    .await","+    .unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(dry.report.namespaces_removed, 5);","+    assert_eq!(dry.report.files_evicted, removed_public.len() + removed_private.len() + 3);","+    eprintln!(\"DRY-RUN PRESERVED PATH: {}\", prefix_without_dash.display());","+    assert!(prefix_without_dash.exists());","+","+    let applied = prune_orphaned_namespaces(","+        cache_dir,","+        &active,","+        PrivateScopePolicy::Keep,","+        CacheGcEffect::Apply,","+    )","+    .await","+    .unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(applied.report, dry.report);","+","+    for path in active_public.iter().chain(&active_private) {","+        eprintln!(\"ACTIVE PATH: {}\", path.display());","+        assert!(path.exists());","+    }","+    for path in removed_public","+        .iter()","+        .chain(&removed_private)","+        .chain([&prefix_without_dash, &prefix_with_dash, &private_prefix_without_dash])","+    {","+        eprintln!(\"ORPHAN PATH: {}\", path.display());","+        assert!(!path.exists());","+    }","+    for orphan_dir in [","+        \"~public/zzz\",","+        \"~upstreams/old\",","+        \"~public/abcdef\",","+        \"~public/abc-stale\",","+        \"~upstreams/privdef\",","+    ] {","+        let dir = cache_dir.join(orphan_dir);","+        eprintln!(\"ORPHAN DIR: {}\", dir.display());","+        assert!(!dir.exists());","+    }","+}"],"additions":125,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server.rs","lines":["@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@","+pub(crate) mod ecosystem;","+"," pub(crate) use client_ip::{ClientIp, resolve_client_ip};"," pub(crate) use grant_directory::validate_for as validate_grant;"," pub use lifecycle::{prepare_storage, serve, serve_listener, serve_listener_with};","@@ -125,7 +127,6 @@ mod cargo;"," mod client_ip;"," mod compiler_cache;"," mod documents;","-mod ecosystem;"," mod health;"," use health::shutdown_signal;"," mod keyed_semaphores;"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server/ecosystem.rs","lines":["@@ -248,6 +248,34 @@ pub(super) async fn load_upstream_document(","     }"," }"," ","+/// Sub-caches nested inside an upstream's cache namespace directory so","+/// [`crate::cache_maintenance::active_cache_namespaces`] and orphan pruning","+/// retain and reclaim the upstream's whole tree under `<cache>/<namespace>/`","+/// without colliding with `<cache>/<namespace>/packages/`.","+#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq)]","+pub(crate) enum UpstreamCacheSubtree<'key> {","+    /// Cargo `.crate` and Python wheel or sdist blobs keyed by SRI integrity.","+    Artifact(&'key [u8]),","+    /// Python PEP 658 `.metadata` documents keyed by URL and descriptor.","+    Metadata(&'key [u8]),","+    /// OCI upstream manifests keyed by tag or digest reference.","+    OciManifest(&'key [u8]),","+    /// OCI upstream blobs.","+    OciBlobs,","+}","+","+impl UpstreamCacheSubtree<'_> {","+    #[must_use]","+    pub(crate) fn within(self, namespace: &str) -> String {","+        match self {","+            Self::Artifact(key) => format!(\"{namespace}/artifacts/{}\", sha256_hex(key)),","+            Self::Metadata(key) => format!(\"{namespace}/metadata/{}\", sha256_hex(key)),","+            Self::OciManifest(key) => format!(\"{namespace}/oci-manifests/{}\", sha256_hex(key)),","+            Self::OciBlobs => format!(\"{namespace}/oci-blobs\"),","+        }","+    }","+}","+"," /// Serve an upstream artifact: the cached copy when there is one, else the"," /// bytes streamed from `url` into the cache while verified against"," /// `integrity` (see `streaming::stream_verified_to_cache` for what a","@@ -262,7 +290,8 @@ pub(super) async fn serve_upstream_artifact(","     url: &str,","     integrity: &Integrity,"," ) -> Response {","-    let namespace = format!(\"{namespace}-{}\", sha256_hex(integrity.to_string().as_bytes()));","+    let namespace =","+        UpstreamCacheSubtree::Artifact(integrity.to_string().as_bytes()).within(namespace);","     let namespace = namespace.as_str();","     if upstream.caches()","         && let Some(response) = cached_upstream_tarball(state, namespace, name, filename).await"],"additions":30,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server/oci/proxy.rs","lines":["@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@ use super::{"," };"," use crate::server::{","     RegistrySource,","-    ecosystem::{addressed_registry, sha256_hex, sha256_integrity, upstream_for},","+    ecosystem::{UpstreamCacheSubtree, addressed_registry, sha256_integrity, upstream_for},","     resolve_ecosystem_source, tarball_response, tarball_stream_error,"," };"," use axum::{","@@ -58,7 +58,7 @@ impl Request {","             });","         }","         let (upstream, namespace) = upstream_for(&self.state, &self.identity, source, key)?;","-        let namespace = format!(\"{namespace}-oci-manifest-{}\", sha256_hex(reference.as_bytes()));","+        let namespace = UpstreamCacheSubtree::OciManifest(reference.as_bytes()).within(&namespace);","         let storage = &self.state.inner.storage;","         let ttl = if Digest::parse(reference).is_ok() {","             Duration::MAX","@@ -122,8 +122,8 @@ impl Request {","             Ok(found) => found,","             Err(err) => return registry_error(err),","         };","-        let result =","-            self.proxied_blob(&upstream, &format!(\"{namespace}-oci-blobs\"), key, digest).await;","+        let blob_namespace = UpstreamCacheSubtree::OciBlobs.within(&namespace);","+        let result = self.proxied_blob(&upstream, &blob_namespace, key, digest).await;","         let mut response = result.unwrap_or_else(IntoResponse::into_response);","         if response.status().is_success() {","             super::insert_header(&mut response, DOCKER_CONTENT_DIGEST, &digest.to_string());"],"additions":4,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server/pypi.rs","lines":["@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@ use super::{","     authorize_package, authorize_with_ownership,","     documents::{lookup_in_hosted_document, read_hosted_document},","     ecosystem::{","-        UpstreamDocument, addressed_registry, caller_scoped, hosted_sources,","+        UpstreamCacheSubtree, UpstreamDocument, addressed_registry, caller_scoped, hosted_sources,","         is_fetchable_artifact_url, load_upstream_document, mount_bases, registry_endpoint,","         serve_hosted_blob, serve_upstream_artifact, sha256_hex, sha256_integrity, upstream_for,","     },"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server/pypi/metadata.rs","lines":["@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@","-use super::{AppState, CanonicalPackageName, ProjectFile, RegistryError, not_found, sha256_hex};","+use super::{","+    AppState, CanonicalPackageName, ProjectFile, RegistryError, UpstreamCacheSubtree, not_found,","+};"," use axum::{","     http::header,","     response::{IntoResponse, Response},","@@ -22,7 +24,7 @@ pub(super) async fn serve(","     let url = metadata_url(distribution_url);","     let descriptor = serde_json::to_string(metadata).expect(\"metadata serializes\");","     let namespace =","-        format!(\"{namespace}-metadata-{}\", sha256_hex(format!(\"{url}\\n{descriptor}\").as_bytes()));","+        UpstreamCacheSubtree::Metadata(format!(\"{url}\\n{descriptor}\").as_bytes()).within(namespace);","     match load(state, upstream, &namespace, key, metadata, &url).await {","         Ok(Some(bytes)) => {","             ([(header::CONTENT_TYPE, \"text/plain; charset=utf-8\")], bytes).into_response()"],"additions":4,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/tests/cache_eviction.rs","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@"," //! Integration tests for whole-cache reclamation, orphan pruning,"," //! and LRU/TTL eviction across upstream and resolver caches."," ","+mod ecosystem_upstreams;"," mod security_and_scopes;"," mod sqlite_security;"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/tests/cache_eviction/ecosystem_upstreams.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,375 @@","+//! End-to-end cache-gc, startup orphan pruning, and TTL/LRU eviction tests for","+//! Cargo, Python, and OCI upstream caches.","+","+use super::create_file_with_age;","+use crate::ecosystem::{body_bytes, sha256_hex};","+use axum::{","+    Router,","+    body::Body,","+    http::{Request, StatusCode},","+};","+use pnpr::{","+    AuthState, Command, Config,","+    cache_maintenance::{","+        CacheGcEffect, CacheGcOptions, CacheGcScope, active_cache_namespaces, collect_cache,","+        prune_orphaned_namespaces_startup,","+    },","+    router_with_auth, run_command,","+};","+use serde_json::json;","+use std::{","+    net::{Ipv4Addr, SocketAddr, SocketAddrV4},","+    path::Path,","+    time::Duration,","+};","+use tempfile::TempDir;","+use tower::ServiceExt;","+","+fn oci_manifest_bytes(config_payload: &[u8], layer_payload: &[u8]) -> Vec<u8> {","+    let config_digest = format!(\"sha256:{}\", sha256_hex(config_payload));","+    let layer_digest = format!(\"sha256:{}\", sha256_hex(layer_payload));","+    serde_json::to_vec(&json!({","+        \"schemaVersion\": 2,","+        \"mediaType\": \"application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json\",","+        \"config\": { \"digest\": config_digest, \"size\": config_payload.len() },","+        \"layers\": [{ \"digest\": layer_digest, \"size\": layer_payload.len() }],","+    }))","+    .unwrap()","+}","+","+fn write_ecosystem_config(","+    tmp: &TempDir,","+    config_name: &str,","+    upstream_url: Option<&str>,","+) -> (Config, Config) {","+    let listen = SocketAddr::V4(SocketAddrV4::new(Ipv4Addr::LOCALHOST, 7677));","+    let public_url = \"http://pnpr.test\".to_string();","+    let storage = tmp.path().join(\"storage\");","+    let cache = tmp.path().join(\"cache\");","+    let registries_block = match upstream_url {","+        Some(url) => format!(","+            r\"registries:","+  npmjs:","+    type: upstream","+    url: https://registry.npmjs.org/","+    public: true","+  crates-up:","+    type: upstream","+    ecosystem: cargo","+    url: {url}/","+    public: true","+  pypi-up:","+    type: upstream","+    ecosystem: pypi","+    url: {url}/","+    public: true","+  oci-up:","+    type: upstream","+    ecosystem: oci","+    url: {url}/","+    public: true","+defaultRegistry:","+  npm: npmjs","+  cargo: crates-up","+  pypi: pypi-up","+  oci: oci-up","+\",","+        ),","+        None => r\"registries:","+  npmjs:","+    type: upstream","+    url: https://registry.npmjs.org/","+    public: true","+defaultRegistry:","+  npm: npmjs","+\"","+        .to_string(),","+    };","+    let yaml = format!(","+        r\"storage: {storage}","+cache: {cache}","+secret: 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef","+packumentTtl: 1h","+routes:","+  allowedPrivateNetworks:","+    - 127.0.0.0/8","+    - ::1/128","+{registries_block}\",","+        storage = storage.display(),","+        cache = cache.display(),","+    );","+    let config_path = tmp.path().join(config_name);","+    std::fs::write(&config_path, yaml).unwrap();","+    let seeded = pnpr_fixtures::load_seeded_config(&config_path, listen, Some(public_url.clone()));","+    let cli_config = Config::from_yaml(&config_path, listen, Some(public_url)).unwrap();","+    (seeded, cli_config)","+}","+","+async fn get_ok_bytes(app: &Router, path: &str) -> Vec<u8> {","+    let response = app","+        .clone()","+        .oneshot(","+            Request::get(path)","+                .body(Body::empty())","+                .unwrap(),","+        )","+        .await","+        .unwrap();","+    let status = response.status();","+    let bytes = body_bytes(response.into_body()).await;","+    assert_eq!(status, StatusCode::OK, \"GET {path} failed with {status}\");","+    bytes","+}","+","+#[tokio::test]","+async fn cache_gc_and_startup_retain_active_cargo_pypi_and_oci_upstreams_then_prune_when_removed() {","+    let mut upstream = mockito::Server::new_async().await;","+    let crate_bytes = b\"fake-crate-archive-bytes\";","+    let wheel_bytes = b\"fake-wheel-archive-bytes\";","+    let metadata_bytes = b\"Metadata-Version: 2.1\\nName: requests\\nVersion: 1.0.0\\n\";","+    let oci_layer = b\"fake-oci-layer-bytes\";","+    let oci_layer_digest = format!(\"sha256:{}\", sha256_hex(oci_layer));","+    let oci_manifest = oci_manifest_bytes(b\"{}\", oci_layer);","+","+    let cargo_config = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", \"/config.json\")","+        .with_body(","+            json!({","+                \"dl\": format!(\"{}/api/v1/crates\", upstream.url()),","+                \"api\": upstream.url(),","+            })","+            .to_string(),","+        )","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+    let cargo_index = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", \"/my/cr/mycrate\")","+        .with_body(format!(","+            \"{}\\n\",","+            json!({","+                \"name\": \"mycrate\",","+                \"vers\": \"1.0.0\",","+                \"deps\": [],","+                \"cksum\": sha256_hex(crate_bytes),","+                \"features\": {},","+                \"yanked\": false,","+            }),","+        ))","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+    let cargo_download = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", \"/api/v1/crates/mycrate/1.0.0/download\")","+        .with_body(crate_bytes.as_slice())","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+","+    let wheel_filename = \"requests-1.0.0-py3-none-any.whl\";","+    let pypi_page = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", \"/requests/\")","+        .with_body(","+            json!({","+                \"meta\": { \"api-version\": \"1.0\" },","+                \"name\": \"requests\",","+                \"files\": [{","+                    \"filename\": wheel_filename,","+                    \"url\": format!(\"{}/packages/{wheel_filename}\", upstream.url()),","+                    \"hashes\": { \"sha256\": sha256_hex(wheel_bytes) },","+                    \"core-metadata\": { \"sha256\": sha256_hex(metadata_bytes) },","+                }],","+            })","+            .to_string(),","+        )","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+    let pypi_wheel = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", format!(\"/packages/{wheel_filename}\").as_str())","+        .with_body(wheel_bytes.as_slice())","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+    let pypi_metadata = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", format!(\"/packages/{wheel_filename}.metadata\").as_str())","+        .with_body(metadata_bytes.as_slice())","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+","+    let oci_manifest_mock = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", \"/v2/library/alpine/manifests/1.0\")","+        .with_header(\"content-type\", \"application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json\")","+        .with_body(oci_manifest.clone())","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+    let oci_blob_mock = upstream","+        .mock(\"GET\", format!(\"/v2/library/alpine/blobs/{oci_layer_digest}\").as_str())","+        .with_body(oci_layer.as_slice())","+        .expect(1)","+        .create_async()","+        .await;","+","+    let tmp = TempDir::new().unwrap();","+    let (config, cli_config) = write_ecosystem_config(&tmp, \"pnpr.yaml\", Some(&upstream.url()));","+    let app = router_with_auth(config.clone(), AuthState::in_memory());","+","+    let cargo_url = \"/cargo/~crates-up/api/v1/crates/mycrate/1.0.0/download\";","+    let wheel_url = format!(\"/pypi/~pypi-up/files/requests/{wheel_filename}\");","+    let metadata_url = format!(\"/pypi/~pypi-up/files/requests/{wheel_filename}.metadata\");","+    let manifest_url = \"/v2/library/alpine/manifests/1.0\";","+    let blob_url = format!(\"/v2/library/alpine/blobs/{oci_layer_digest}\");","+","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, cargo_url).await, crate_bytes);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, &wheel_url).await, wheel_bytes);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, &metadata_url).await, metadata_bytes);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, manifest_url).await, oci_manifest);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, &blob_url).await, oci_layer);","+","+    cargo_index.assert_async().await;","+    cargo_download.assert_async().await;","+    pypi_page.assert_async().await;","+    pypi_wheel.assert_async().await;","+    pypi_metadata.assert_async().await;","+    oci_manifest_mock.assert_async().await;","+    oci_blob_mock.assert_async().await;","+","+    for mock in [","+        cargo_config,","+        cargo_index,","+        cargo_download,","+        pypi_page,","+        pypi_wheel,","+        pypi_metadata,","+        oci_manifest_mock,","+        oci_blob_mock,","+    ] {","+        mock.remove_async().await;","+    }","+    drop(upstream);","+","+    let public_dirs_count = count_subdirs(&config.storage.cache_dir.join(\"~public\"));","+    assert_eq!(","+        public_dirs_count, 3,","+        \"each populated public upstream owns one directory under ~public\",","+    );","+","+    run_command(","+        &cli_config,","+        Command::CacheGc { dry_run: false, max_size: None, max_age: None, orphans_only: true },","+    )","+    .await","+    .unwrap();","+","+    let startup_report = prune_orphaned_namespaces_startup(&config).await.unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(startup_report.namespaces_removed, 0);","+    assert_eq!(startup_report.files_evicted, 0);","+","+    let periodic_report = collect_cache(","+        &config,","+        &CacheGcOptions {","+            effect: CacheGcEffect::Apply,","+            max_size: Some(10 * 1024 * 1024),","+            max_age: Some(Duration::from_hours(24)),","+            scope: CacheGcScope::Full,","+        },","+    )","+    .await","+    .unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(periodic_report.namespaces_removed, 0);","+    assert_eq!(periodic_report.files_evicted, 0);","+","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, cargo_url).await, crate_bytes);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, &wheel_url).await, wheel_bytes);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, &metadata_url).await, metadata_bytes);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, manifest_url).await, oci_manifest);","+    assert_eq!(get_ok_bytes(&app, &blob_url).await, oci_layer);","+","+    let (reduced_config, reduced_cli_config) = write_ecosystem_config(&tmp, \"reduced.yaml\", None);","+    let dry_prune = collect_cache(","+        &reduced_config,","+        &CacheGcOptions {","+            effect: CacheGcEffect::DryRun,","+            max_size: None,","+            max_age: None,","+            scope: CacheGcScope::OrphansOnly,","+        },","+    )","+    .await","+    .unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(dry_prune.namespaces_removed, 3);","+    assert_eq!(dry_prune.files_evicted, 8);","+","+    run_command(","+        &reduced_cli_config,","+        Command::CacheGc { dry_run: false, max_size: None, max_age: None, orphans_only: true },","+    )","+    .await","+    .unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(count_subdirs(&reduced_config